---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { u } from "../consts";
const mapDest = "5521%20South%20York%20Highway%2C%20Grimsley%2C%20TN%2038565";
---
<Base
  title="Where We Are — Grimsley, Tennessee — Grimsley Mineral Co."
  description="Grimsley Mineral Co. is on US-127 in Grimsley, Tennessee. It is where the collection, the lamps and the workbench all live."
  active=""
>
  <div class="pagehead">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="crumb"><a href={u("")}>Home</a> / Where We Are</div>
      <h1>Grimsley, Tennessee</h1>
      <p>This is where everything lives. Not a regular storefront with posted hours, but it's where we work, keep the collection, photograph pieces and build things.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The page says "not a regular storefront." Rather than explain that in
       another paragraph, show it: the table, the shelves, the floor mid-sort.
       Captions stay descriptive — no event, no date, no locality. -->
  <figure class="photoband">
    <img src={u("img/room/mixed-table-full-spread.webp")} alt="A long table laid out with mineral specimens, quartz points, spheres, bowls of tumbled stones and jewelry, with lava lamps on the shelf behind it" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </figure>

  <div class="visit">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="info">
        <div class="k">The address</div>
        <h2>5521 South York Hwy</h2>
        <div class="addr">
          Grimsley, TN 38565<br />
          On US-127, between Dollar General &amp; Taco Bros
        </div>
        <div class="btns">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href={`https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=${mapDest}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions</a>
          <a class="btn btn-line" href={u("contact")}>Send a message</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mapbox live">
        <iframe
          title="Map to 5521 South York Highway, Grimsley TN"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=5521+South+York+Highway,+Grimsley,+TN+38565&output=embed"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>If you're nearby and trying to see something specific, <a href={u("contact")}>message us</a>. Most of the collection isn't sitting out.</p>
    <p>There's no checkout on this site, which is deliberate. Reserve a piece and we come back to you with a shipping quote to your address, then take payment by Square, Zelle, Cash App or cash.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
